sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant E as Edge Gateway
  participant A as platform-api
  participant R as Pure runtime
  participant M as MongoDB Atlas
  participant O as Outbox publisher
  C->>E: Intent + idempotency key
  E->>A: Authenticated request with request ID
  A->>A: Verify token, tenancy, action schema
  A->>M: Load definition/state/idempotency
  A->>R: Evaluate with logical time and seed
  R-->>A: Immutable execution plan or denial
  A->>M: Commit state, ledger, receipt, audit, outbox
  A-->>C: Receipt, state version, event IDs
  O->>M: Read pending outbox
  O-->>C: No direct delivery; consumers receive MSK event
